Source code and original artwork
  The source code in this package and the illustrated images generated by scripts/generate-art.ts are original to this template and
  are licensed to you under that agreement. The images are generated procedurally from code (no photography and no third-party
  artwork) — see ASSET_LICENSES.md.

Third-party software
  Dependencies (React, React Router, Vite, Fontsource Fraunces and Manrope, and the development tooling listed in package.json) remain
  under their own open-source licenses (MIT, SIL OFL 1.1 for the two typefaces, etc.). Their license texts ship inside node_modules after
  `npm ci`.

Brands
  "HAVEN STAYS", "Cala Verana", the staff, guests, addresses, phone numbers and reviews are fictional demonstration content. Replace
  them with your client's real brand and facts before launch. "OneStop Infinite" identifies the template publisher only and is kept
  separate from the hotel brand in src/config/site.ts (site.publisher).

No warranty
  The template is provided "as is". The booking engine is a front-end demonstration: it does not reserve rooms, take payments or send
  data anywhere. See README.md → Booking limitations.
